<title>TURKEY: Turkish Airlines,Swissair joint flights.</title>
<headline>Turkish Airlines,Swissair joint flights.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish Airlines (THY) announced on Friday it would begin joint flights with Swissair on the route between the Turkish port city of Izmir and Zurich.</p>
<p>In a statement, Turkish Airlines said Swissair A320 aircraft would be flying between the two cities every day from May 4, enhancing the existing weekend service, with two flights a day now planned for Saturdays and Sundays.</p>
</text>
